  {"cell_type": "markdown", "source": ["# 复利计算实验\n", "每年投 1 万，**年化 12.5%**，22 年后："]},
  {"cell_type": "code", "execution_count": 1, "metadata": {}, "outputs": [
    {"output_type": "stream", "name": "stdout", "text": ["本金 10000，年化 0.125\n"]},
    {"output_type": "execute_result", "data": {"text/plain": ["1110413.5"]}, "metadata": {}}
  ], "source": ["def compound(principal, rate, years):\n", "    for _ in range(years):\n", "        principal *= (1 + rate)\n", "    return principal\n", "\n", "compound(10000, 0.125, 22)"]},
  {"cell_type": "markdown", "source": ["结论：约 **111 万**。"]}
